  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "In the menu options if we could have a built in Text to Speech keyboard so those of us that are mute can use that instead of a 3rd party sketchy program it would help a lot of people be able to communicate more. I dont care if Id sound like Hstsune Miku, trying to switch in and out of programs just to type a simple sentence is gonna drive me insane.",
